<title>JAPAN: Matsushita Electric to set up Thai fan venture.</title>
<headline>Matsushita Electric to set up Thai fan venture.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Matsushita Electric Industrial Co Ltd said on Tuesday that its wholly owned subsidiary Matsushita Seiko Co Ltd would establish a joint venture in Thailand to make and market ventilators, electric fans and air blowers.</p>
<p>The venture will be set up in January and capitalised at about 250 million baht. It will be 60 percent held by Matsushita Seiko and the rest by local companies, a Matsushita spokesman said.</p>
<p>The venture will aim for sales of 461 million baht in 1997 and 1.4 billion baht by 2001, the spokesman said.</p>
</text>
